# DITA Migration Agent v2

An autonomous AI-powered tool that automatically fixes AsciiDoc files to make them compatible with DITA (Darwin Information Typing Architecture) format.

## Features

- **Three-Phase Processing**
  - Phase 1: Content Type Assignment (`:_module-type:` attribute)
  - Phase 2: Callouts Conversion (code block callouts to DITA format)
  - Phase 3: All Other DITA Issues (30+ Vale rules)

- **LLM-Powered Fixes**
  - Uses Gemini API for intelligent, context-aware fixes
  - Targeted edits (not full file rewrites) to preserve content
  - Automatic rollback on syntax errors

- **Flexible Scope**
  - Process entire project
  - Single assembly with all includes
  - Specific topic files
  - First N files with issues

## Quick Start

### Installation

**Option 1: Direct Install (Recommended)**
```bash
pip install https://github.com/gtrivedi88/dita-migration-agent-v2/archive/main.zip
```

**Option 2: Clone & Install (Development)**
```bash
git clone https://github.com/gtrivedi88/dita-migration-agent-v2.git
cd dita-migration-agent-v2
pip install -e .
```

### Setup (One-Time)

```bash
dita-agent setup
```

This will:
- Clone required tool repositories to `~/.dita-agent/tools/`
- Check Vale installation
- Configure Gemini API credentials
- Create config at `~/.dita-agent/config.json`

### Run Migration

```bash
# Navigate to your documentation project
cd your-project

# Process entire project
dita-agent run

# Process single assembly + all its includes
dita-agent run --assembly path/to/master.adoc

# Process specific topics (up to 10)
dita-agent run --topics topic1.adoc topic2.adoc

# Process first N files with issues
dita-agent run --limit 5

# Preview without making changes
dita-agent run --dry-run
```

## Configuration

### Global Config (`~/.dita-agent/config.json`)

```json
{
  "provider": "gemini",
  "base_url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com",
  "model": "gemini-3-flash-preview",
  "api_key": "your-api-key"
}
```

### Project Files

The agent creates a `.dita-agent/` directory in your project for:
- Backup files (before each modification)
- Session logs
- Temporary files

This directory is automatically added to `.gitignore`.

## Output

### Success

```
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  ✅ SUCCESS - All DITA compatibility issues resolved!
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  Files processed: 6
  Phase 1 (Content Type): 6 fixed
  Phase 2 (Callouts): 3 fixed
  Phase 3 (DITA Issues): 12 fixed
  Total LLM calls: 21
  Cost: $0.12
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
```

### Partial Success

When some issues can't be fixed automatically:

```
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  ⚠️  PARTIAL SUCCESS
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  Files processed: 6
  Issues fixed: 18
  Issues needing manual review: 2
  
  📄 See: MANUAL_REVIEW.md
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
```

## Requirements

- Python 3.10+
- Git (for cloning tool repositories)
- Vale linter
- Gemini API access

## External Dependencies

| Repository | Purpose |
|------------|---------|
| [asciidoctor-dita-vale](https://github.com/jhradilek/asciidoctor-dita-vale) | Vale rules for DITA validation |
| [callouts-conversion](https://github.com/gtrivedi88/callouts-conversion) | Automated callout fixing tool |

## Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  USER INPUT: dita-agent run --assembly master.adoc     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │
                           ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  SCOPE RESOLUTION                                       │
│  Identify all files to process (assembly + includes)   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │
                           ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  PHASE 1: CONTENT TYPE ASSIGNMENT                       │
│  Add :_module-type: attribute to all files             │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │
                           ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  PHASE 2: CALLOUTS CONVERSION                           │
│  Convert callout markers to DITA-compatible format     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │
                           ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  PHASE 3: ALL OTHER DITA ISSUES                         │
│  Fix remaining issues (ShortDescription, TaskStep...)  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │
                           ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  OUTPUT: Success report + optional MANUAL_REVIEW.md    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

